FreeRDP 3.32.0 RDPDR server fixes applied by build_rdpserver.py before it
builds FreeRDP (FreeRDP is Apache-2.0). Read and write requests keep the
64-bit offsets of the wire format, and a write acknowledgement carries a
length but no data payload ([MS-RDPEFS] 2.2.3.4.4).

